  "text" : {
    "status" : "extensions",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-eac-intervention-services-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-eac-intervention-services-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-eac-intervention-services-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-eac-form-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version &#x1F4E6;0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-service-education\">service-education</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Education</td><td>Education was provided to address adherence needs.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-service-individual-counselling\">service-individual-counselling</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Individual counselling</td><td>Individual adherence counselling was provided.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-service-group-counselling\">service-group-counselling</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Group counselling</td><td>Group adherence counselling was provided.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-service-peer-support\">service-peer-support</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Peer support</td><td>Peer-based adherence support was provided.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-service-treatment-buddy\">service-treatment-buddy</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Treatment buddy</td><td>A treatment buddy was established or supported.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-service-extended-drug-pick-up\">service-extended-drug-pick-up</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Extended drug pick-up</td><td>An extended medicine pick-up arrangement was provided.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-service-community-art-group\">service-community-art-group</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Community ART group</td><td>The client was linked to or supported through a community ART group.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-service-directly-observed-therapy\">service-directly-observed-therapy</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Directly observed therapy</td><td>Direct observation of treatment was provided or arranged.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-service-other\">service-other</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Other service intervention</td><td>A service intervention not represented by another code; specify separately.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
